|---|---|---|---|
| Ephemeral | `ephemeral` | `storage/memory_asset.py` | In-memory; optional JSON asset seed at startup; for tests and CI |
| File | `file` | `storage/file.py` | Breakpoint JSON documents under `storage_root/` (default `./.data`) |
